{"name":"note-2026-04-27-1","fixed":false,"html":"<p><span data-search-node=\"t0\">以前我很在意自己是不是足够“优秀”。</span><br/><span data-search-node=\"t1\">\n</span><span data-search-node=\"t2\">现在我觉得“优秀”这个词只是学校里的语言。</span><br/><span data-search-node=\"t3\">\n</span><span data-search-node=\"t4\">它通常意味着听话、稳定、完成任务。</span><br/><span data-search-node=\"t5\">\n</span><span data-search-node=\"t6\">但赚钱需要的是另一套能力：判断需求，承担风险，接受反馈。</span></p>"}
