{"name":"note-2026-09-20-1","fixed":false,"html":"<p><span data-search-node=\"t0\">正常人是：努力学习-&gt;获得更好学历-&gt;找到更好工作-&gt;搞钱。</span><br/><span data-search-node=\"t1\">\n</span><span data-search-node=\"t2\">为什么不是：直接思考怎么搞钱。</span></p>"}
